{"title":"Act Security — Blog","url":"https://act.security/resources?resources-category=blog","favicon":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5c93a0f204be1459f417f5/6a67b06c6b293291507e159a_card.png","elements":[{"title":"What is Cloud Security Intent Enforcement (CSIE)? Breaking down the new cloud security category","contents":"<div class=\"resources_card\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" data-clip-sq=\"tl tr bl br\" class=\"resources_card-visual-w\" style=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6af468f641cf9543f7c24068_170285.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6af468f641cf9543f7c24068_170285-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6af468f641cf9543f7c24068_170285-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6af468f641cf9543f7c24068_170285.png 810w\" class=\"img_abs is-resources\"></div><div class=\"resources_card-text\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-16 is-left is-grow\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-8 is-left\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-6 is-left\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" style=\"background-color: rgb(127, 197, 248); color: rgb(52, 12, 5);\" class=\"resources_tag\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\">Blog</div></div><h3 fs-list-field=\"title\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"heading-style-h4 text-weight-normal\" style=\"\">What is Cloud Security Intent Enforcement (CSIE)? Breaking down the new cloud security category</h3></div><p fs-list-field=\"description\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"text-body text-style-2lines\" style=\"\">On October 28, 2026, SACR defined Cloud Security Intent Enforcement as a new cloud security category. Here is why it exists, how the loop works, and where Act fits.</p></div><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"resources_author-w\" style=\"\"><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"text-caption text-color-grey-medium\">Hadar Landau</div><div fs-list-field=\"date\" class=\"text-caption text-color-disabled-grey\">November 11, 2026</div></div></div></div><a aria-label=\"Read more\" href=\"/resources/what-is-cloud-security-intent-enforcement-csie-breaking-down-the-new-cloud-security-category\" class=\"link_abs w-inline-block\"></a></div>","link":"https://act.security/resources/what-is-cloud-security-intent-enforcement-csie-breaking-down-the-new-cloud-security-category","retrieved":1794355200000},{"title":"AI-driven attacks aren't the same as AI-found vulnerabilities","contents":"<div class=\"resources_card\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" data-clip-sq=\"tl tr bl br\" class=\"resources_card-visual-w\" style=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6afad6794380460c0b10e2d0_BLOGGGG.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6afad6794380460c0b10e2d0_BLOGGGG-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6afad6794380460c0b10e2d0_BLOGGGG-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6afad6794380460c0b10e2d0_BLOGGGG.png 810w\" class=\"img_abs is-resources\"></div><div class=\"resources_card-text\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-16 is-left is-grow\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-8 is-left\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-6 is-left\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" style=\"background-color: rgb(127, 197, 248); color: rgb(52, 12, 5);\" class=\"resources_tag\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\">Blog</div></div><h3 fs-list-field=\"title\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"heading-style-h4 text-weight-normal\" style=\"\">AI-driven attacks aren't the same as AI-found vulnerabilities</h3></div><p fs-list-field=\"description\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"text-body text-style-2lines\" style=\"\">AI-driven attacks are about speed once inside. AI-found vulnerabilities are about how much becomes exploitable. Two problems, one answer.</p></div><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"resources_author-w\" style=\"\"><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"text-caption text-color-grey-medium\">Hadar Landau</div><div fs-list-field=\"date\" class=\"text-caption text-color-disabled-grey\">November 9, 2026</div></div></div></div><a aria-label=\"Read more\" href=\"/resources/ai-driven-attacks-arent-the-same-as-ai-found-vulnerabilities\" class=\"link_abs w-inline-block\"></a></div>","link":"https://act.security/resources/ai-driven-attacks-arent-the-same-as-ai-found-vulnerabilities","retrieved":1794182400000},{"title":"AI Broke Patching: Why Security Teams Must Rebuild Defense from the Foundation","contents":"<div class=\"resources_card\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" data-clip-sq=\"tl tr bl br\" class=\"resources_card-visual-w\" style=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6adf57032039e173389cc943_blog%20(1).png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6adf57032039e173389cc943_blog%20(1)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6adf57032039e173389cc943_blog%20(1).png 608w\" class=\"img_abs is-resources\"></div><div class=\"resources_card-text\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-16 is-left is-grow\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-8 is-left\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-6 is-left\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" style=\"background-color: rgb(127, 197, 248); color: rgb(52, 12, 5);\" class=\"resources_tag\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\">Blog</div></div><h3 fs-list-field=\"title\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"heading-style-h4 text-weight-normal\" style=\"\">AI Broke Patching: Why Security Teams Must Rebuild Defense from the Foundation</h3></div><p fs-list-field=\"description\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"text-body text-style-2lines\" style=\"\">AI is finding flaws faster than teams can patch, and attackers are exploiting them even faster. Why patching can't be the plan, and what to build instead.</p></div><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"resources_author-w\" style=\"\"><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"text-caption text-color-grey-medium\">Hadar Landau</div><div fs-list-field=\"date\" class=\"text-caption text-color-disabled-grey\">October 26, 2026</div></div></div></div><a aria-label=\"Read more\" href=\"/resources/ai-broke-patching-why-security-teams-must-rebuild-defense-from-the-foundation\" class=\"link_abs w-inline-block\"></a></div>","link":"https://act.security/resources/ai-broke-patching-why-security-teams-must-rebuild-defense-from-the-foundation","retrieved":1792972800000},{"title":"PHP2Shell: exploitability changed overnight. Blast radius didn't have to.","contents":"<div class=\"resources_card\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" data-clip-sq=\"tl tr bl br\" class=\"resources_card-visual-w\" style=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49dd444bc5cd09027dbb_php2shell-exploitability-changed-overnight.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49dd444bc5cd09027dbb_php2shell-exploitability-changed-overnight-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49dd444bc5cd09027dbb_php2shell-exploitability-changed-overnight-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49dd444bc5cd09027dbb_php2shell-exploitability-changed-overnight.webp 810w\" class=\"img_abs is-resources\"></div><div class=\"resources_card-text\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-16 is-left is-grow\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-8 is-left\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-6 is-left\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" style=\"background-color: rgb(127, 197, 248); color: rgb(52, 12, 5);\" class=\"resources_tag\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\">Blog</div></div><h3 fs-list-field=\"title\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"heading-style-h4 text-weight-normal\" style=\"\">PHP2Shell: exploitability changed overnight. Blast radius didn't have to.</h3></div><p fs-list-field=\"description\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"text-body text-style-2lines\" style=\"\">Ten years of nothing, then two days with AI, and a quiet PHP bug became a way into your cloud. PHP2Shell is a pair of critical CVEs in core PHP that let an unauthenticated attacker run code on an exposed server or read credentials straight out of memory. The attacker lands as the PHP worker, with every cloud role and secret it holds. You can’t patch every runtime overnight, but you can remove the access an attacker would use in the first place.</p></div><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"resources_author-w\" style=\"\"><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"text-caption text-color-grey-medium\">Kobi Rubin</div><div fs-list-field=\"date\" class=\"text-caption text-color-disabled-grey\">October 22, 2026</div></div></div></div><a aria-label=\"Read more\" href=\"/resources/php2shell-exploitability-changed-overnight-blast-radius-didnt-have-to\" class=\"link_abs w-inline-block\"></a></div>","link":"https://act.security/resources/php2shell-exploitability-changed-overnight-blast-radius-didnt-have-to","retrieved":1792627200000},{"title":"How HUB International Built a Secure Home for AI Coding Agents in Two Days Using Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","contents":"<div class=\"resources_card\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" data-clip-sq=\"tl tr bl br\" class=\"resources_card-visual-w\" style=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6ad605c2dbd8da4a0d9b23b9_for%20blog%20(3).png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6ad605c2dbd8da4a0d9b23b9_for%20blog%20(3)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6ad605c2dbd8da4a0d9b23b9_for%20blog%20(3).png 608w\" class=\"img_abs is-resources\"></div><div class=\"resources_card-text\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-16 is-left is-grow\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-8 is-left\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-6 is-left\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" style=\"background-color: rgb(127, 197, 248); color: rgb(52, 12, 5);\" class=\"resources_tag\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\">Blog</div></div><h3 fs-list-field=\"title\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"heading-style-h4 text-weight-normal\" style=\"\">How HUB International Built a Secure Home for AI Coding Agents in Two Days Using Amazon Bedrock AgentCore</h3></div><p fs-list-field=\"description\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"text-body text-style-2lines\" style=\"\">Working alongside AWS and Act Security, HUB moved the local Claude Code experience into cloud-hosted sandboxes in two days: the same terminal and IDE, sessions that survive a closed laptop, no credentials in the agent, and every action attributed to a named developer under central control.</p></div><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"resources_author-w\" style=\"\"><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"text-caption text-color-grey-medium\">Maya Folman Avneri</div><div fs-list-field=\"date\" class=\"text-caption text-color-disabled-grey\">October 19, 2026</div></div></div></div><a aria-label=\"Read more\" href=\"/resources/how-hub-international-built-a-secure-home-for-ai-coding-agents-in-two-days-using-amazon-bedrock-agentcore\" class=\"link_abs w-inline-block\"></a></div>","link":"https://act.security/resources/how-hub-international-built-a-secure-home-for-ai-coding-agents-in-two-days-using-amazon-bedrock-agentcore","retrieved":1792368000000},{"title":"Lambda Web Functions: public by default, and already in your lambda:* grants","contents":"<div class=\"resources_card\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" data-clip-sq=\"tl tr bl br\" class=\"resources_card-visual-w\" style=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49cc614c7433c00260b1_lambda-web-functions-public-by-default.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49cc614c7433c00260b1_lambda-web-functions-public-by-default-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49cc614c7433c00260b1_lambda-web-functions-public-by-default-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49cc614c7433c00260b1_lambda-web-functions-public-by-default.webp 810w\" class=\"img_abs is-resources\"></div><div class=\"resources_card-text\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-16 is-left is-grow\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-8 is-left\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-6 is-left\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" style=\"background-color: rgb(127, 197, 248); color: rgb(52, 12, 5);\" class=\"resources_tag\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\">Blog</div></div><h3 fs-list-field=\"title\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"heading-style-h4 text-weight-normal\" style=\"\">Lambda Web Functions: public by default, and already in your lambda:* grants</h3></div><p fs-list-field=\"description\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"text-body text-style-2lines\" style=\"\">Lambda Web Functions launched on 13 October. The endpoint auth type defaults to none, one execution role serves every request, existing lambda:* grants already cover it, and posture scanners can't see it yet.</p></div><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"resources_author-w\" style=\"\"><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"text-caption text-color-grey-medium\">Kobi Rubin</div><div fs-list-field=\"date\" class=\"text-caption text-color-disabled-grey\">October 14, 2026</div></div></div></div><a aria-label=\"Read more\" href=\"/resources/lambda-web-functions-public-by-default\" class=\"link_abs w-inline-block\"></a></div>","link":"https://act.security/resources/lambda-web-functions-public-by-default","retrieved":1791936000000},{"title":"Lambda Web Functions go global in one command. Your controls don't.","contents":"<div class=\"resources_card\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" data-clip-sq=\"tl tr bl br\" class=\"resources_card-visual-w\" style=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49d3140ab0447c09b8c1_lambda-web-functions-go-global.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49d3140ab0447c09b8c1_lambda-web-functions-go-global-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49d3140ab0447c09b8c1_lambda-web-functions-go-global-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49d3140ab0447c09b8c1_lambda-web-functions-go-global.webp 810w\" class=\"img_abs is-resources\"></div><div class=\"resources_card-text\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-16 is-left is-grow\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-8 is-left\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-6 is-left\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" style=\"background-color: rgb(127, 197, 248); color: rgb(52, 12, 5);\" class=\"resources_tag\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\">Blog</div></div><h3 fs-list-field=\"title\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"heading-style-h4 text-weight-normal\" style=\"\">Lambda Web Functions go global in one command. Your controls don't.</h3></div><p fs-list-field=\"description\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"text-body text-style-2lines\" style=\"\">One deploy puts your Lambda Web Function in three regions behind one domain. The access model is replicated with it: slow revokes, secrets copied to every region, and audit gaps that hide who called.</p></div><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"resources_author-w\" style=\"\"><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"text-caption text-color-grey-medium\">Gilad Sharabi</div><div fs-list-field=\"date\" class=\"text-caption text-color-disabled-grey\">October 14, 2026</div></div></div></div><a aria-label=\"Read more\" href=\"/resources/lambda-web-functions-go-global-your-controls-dont\" class=\"link_abs w-inline-block\"></a></div>","link":"https://act.security/resources/lambda-web-functions-go-global-your-controls-dont","retrieved":1791936000000},{"title":"Act Security Wins “Zero Trust Network Access Solution of the Year” in CyberSecurity Breakthrough Awards 2026","contents":"<div class=\"resources_card\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" data-clip-sq=\"tl tr bl br\" class=\"resources_card-visual-w\" style=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49fb93f7f572bbb7d98c_ztna-solution-of-the-year-award.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49fb93f7f572bbb7d98c_ztna-solution-of-the-year-award-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49fb93f7f572bbb7d98c_ztna-solution-of-the-year-award-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49fb93f7f572bbb7d98c_ztna-solution-of-the-year-award-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49fb93f7f572bbb7d98c_ztna-solution-of-the-year-award-p-1600.webp 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49fb93f7f572bbb7d98c_ztna-solution-of-the-year-award.webp 1620w\" class=\"img_abs is-resources\"></div><div class=\"resources_card-text\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-16 is-left is-grow\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-8 is-left\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-6 is-left\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" style=\"background-color: rgb(127, 197, 248); color: rgb(52, 12, 5);\" class=\"resources_tag\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\">Blog</div></div><h3 fs-list-field=\"title\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"heading-style-h4 text-weight-normal\" style=\"\">Act Security Wins “Zero Trust Network Access Solution of the Year” in CyberSecurity Breakthrough Awards 2026 </h3></div><p fs-list-field=\"description\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"text-body text-style-2lines\" style=\"\">The recognition spotlights Act’s access model that reasons across identity, network, and AI as a single layer and scopes every human, workload, and AI agent down to what it genuinely needs, eliminating potential access paths available for agents or attackers.</p></div><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"resources_author-w\" style=\"\"><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"text-caption text-color-grey-medium\">Hadar Landau</div><div fs-list-field=\"date\" class=\"text-caption text-color-disabled-grey\">October 8, 2026</div></div></div></div><a aria-label=\"Read more\" href=\"/resources/act-security-wins-zero-trust-network-access-solution-of-the-year-in-cybersecurity-breakthrough-awards-2026\" class=\"link_abs w-inline-block\"></a></div>","link":"https://act.security/resources/act-security-wins-zero-trust-network-access-solution-of-the-year-in-cybersecurity-breakthrough-awards-2026","retrieved":1791417600000},{"title":"Inside Terraplane: How We Built Our Own Secure, Developer-Friendly Terraform at Act","contents":"<div class=\"resources_card\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" data-clip-sq=\"tl tr bl br\" class=\"resources_card-visual-w\" style=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49bd93f7f572bbb7881c_inside-terraplane.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49bd93f7f572bbb7881c_inside-terraplane-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49bd93f7f572bbb7881c_inside-terraplane-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49bd93f7f572bbb7881c_inside-terraplane-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6aeb49bd93f7f572bbb7881c_inside-terraplane.webp 1215w\" class=\"img_abs is-resources\"></div><div class=\"resources_card-text\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-16 is-left is-grow\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-8 is-left\"><div class=\"heading-with-p is-6 is-left\"><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" style=\"background-color: rgb(127, 197, 248); color: rgb(52, 12, 5);\" class=\"resources_tag\"><div fs-list-field=\"category\">Blog</div></div><h3 fs-list-field=\"title\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"heading-style-h4 text-weight-normal\" style=\"\">Inside Terraplane: How We Built Our Own Secure, Developer-Friendly Terraform at Act</h3></div><p fs-list-field=\"description\" data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"text-body text-style-2lines\" style=\"\">A deep dive into how Act runs every Terraform change through a self-hosted Kubernetes platform engineered for zero standing access and seamless developer workflows.</p></div><div data-animate=\"slide-in\" class=\"resources_author-w\" style=\"\"><div fs-list-field=\"author\" class=\"text-caption text-color-grey-medium\">Evyatar Cohen</div><div fs-list-field=\"date\" class=\"text-caption text-color-disabled-grey\">October 8, 2026</div></div></div></div><a aria-label=\"Read more\" href=\"/resources/inside-terraplane-secure-developer-friendly-terraform-at-act\" class=\"link_abs w-inline-block\"></a></div>","link":"https://act.security/resources/inside-terraplane-secure-developer-friendly-terraform-at-act","retrieved":1791417600000}]}